iua|a|Having certain or distinct; determinate in extent or greatness; limited; fixed; as, definite dimensions; a definite measure; a definite period or interval. ; Having certain limits in signification; determinate; certain; precise; fixed; exact; clear; as, a definite word, term, or expression. ; Determined; resolved. ; Serving to define or restrict; limiting; determining; as, the definite article.	j:1nh3,75,4;4ua,69,5;3fp,31,5~3fp,31,5;4ua,69,5;1nh3,75,4	e:1byh,2,1~1byh,2,1
