k2h|a|The Evil One; Satan, represented as the tempter and spiritual of mankind. ; An evil spirit; a demon. ; A very wicked person; hence, any great evil. ; An expletive of surprise, vexation, or emphasis, or, ironically, of negation. ; A dish, as a bone with the meat, broiled and excessively peppered; a grill with Cayenne pepper. ; A machine for tearing or cutting rags, cotton, etc.	j:jr4,73,3~jr4,73,3
